{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"OSS consensus audit (2026-08-13): APPROVED pattern, already merged as 3182cd470a.\n\nTenacity exposes the sleeper as a dependency and records exact delays without sleeping (jd/tenacity@26f719d, tests/test_tenacity.py#L590-L604). Kubernetes uses testingclock.NewFakeClock for backoff/delay behavior (kubernetes/kubernetes@52ba901, staging/src/k8s.io/apimachinery/pkg/util/wait/wait_test.go#L778-L843). urllib3 mocks time.sleep while retaining Retry-After assertions (urllib3/urllib3@52dfb19, test/test_retry.py#L411-L440).\n\nThe merged late-bound sleeper seams plus exact logical-schedule assertions match this consensus and preserve attempts, jitter bounds, and production schedules. Tracker cross-check found no rejection; fizzy-trunk-salt explicitly cited convergence with urllib3/Tenacity for bounded subprocess/retry behavior."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786638496812723001,"uuid":"52646dc4-1b60-4723-a0aa-19ddab79ea59"}